{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#card-zh","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 插件，通过系统提示词和 respondToDisrespect 工具，让模型记录冒犯并逐步回应。它可先提醒、再给出最后警告，并在后续升级时关闭会话；用户真正说服模型时可以降低记录，承受极端压力时也可记录让步。用户主动要求结束对话时，插件先要求确认。它还提供会话状态命令，并在关闭后锁定浏览器输入框。适合希望为对话加入边界处理和明确结束流程的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:452-463","index.js:514-562","index.js:625-638","client.js:92-124"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#card-en","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-dignity-guard adds a prompt section and response tool to DSH Web. It guides escalating reminders, forgiveness, yielding under pressure, and confirmed conversation closure. Closed sessions become read-only in the browser and host; a command shows status. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:452-463","index.js:514-562","index.js:625-638","client.js:92-124"]}
