{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#feature-1","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 的功能「逐级处理冒犯」：模型调用工具记录冲突；前两次依次得到提醒和最后警告，再次升级时关闭会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:553-562"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#feature-2","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 的功能「确认后结束」：用户请求关闭会话时，工具先返回警告；用户确认后再次调用，才会关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:514-527"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#feature-3","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 的功能「宽恕与让步」：模型可在被说服时减少一次记录，也可在极端压力下留下让步次数和压力类别。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:529-550"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#feature-4","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 的功能「关闭会话锁定」：关闭后浏览器定期读取宿主状态并禁用该会话输入框；宿主也会拒绝用户输入。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:92-124","index.js:576-605"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#feature-5","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 的功能「状态查询」：在会话中运行 /dignity-guard，可查看冲突次数、让步次数、关闭状态、触发原因与模型标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:625-638"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#caveat-1","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dignity-guard 使用浏览器半部锁定输入框，宿主状态不可用时本轮同步会跳过，之后再试；宿主仍单独执行输入拦截。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:92-104","index.js:580-605"]}
{"unit_id":"Alamanes__dsh-dignity-guard#caveat-2","repo":"Alamanes/dsh-dignity-guard","commit":"a060be647461d659c88c0da1617d6445fff9beb6","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"插件重启后仅从会话日志恢复关闭状态；尚未关闭时的冲突和让步计数保存在内存中，进程重启不会恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:226-249","index.js:251-265"]}
